[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:73. The Record-Holder]
[00:00.660]Passage 73 | 文章七十三
[00:02.520]The record holder. | 纪录保持者
[00:05.170]Little boys who play truant from school | 小男孩们从学校逃学，
[00:09.200]are unimaginative. | 都缺乏想象力。
[00:11.280]A quiet day's fishing, | 安静地钓一天鱼，
[00:13.565]or eight hours in a cinema seeing the same film over and over again, | 或者在电影院里看八个小时的同一部电影，
[00:18.635]is usually as far as they get. | 通常是他们能做的极限了。
[00:21.685]They have all been put to shame | 他们都被一个男孩比下去了，
[00:24.825]by a boy who while playing truant | 这个男孩在逃学期间，
[00:27.375]travelled 1,600 miles. | 旅行了1600英里。
[00:30.610]He hitchhiked to Dover | 他搭便车去了多佛，
[00:33.245]and towards evening, went into a boat to find somewhere to sleep. | 傍晚时分，他上了一条船找地方睡觉。
[00:38.070]When he woke up next morning, | 第二天早上他醒来时，
[00:40.535]he discovered that the boat had in the meantime travelled to Calais. | 发现那艘船已经开到了加来。
[00:45.325]No one noticed the boy as he crept off. | 他悄悄溜走时，没有人注意到他。
[00:48.615]From there, he hitchhiked to Paris in a lorry. | 从那里，他搭一辆卡车去了巴黎。
[00:52.895]The driver gave him a few biscuits and a cup of coffee, | 司机给了他几块饼干和一杯咖啡，
[00:56.945]and left him just outside the city. | 然后把他留在了城外。
[00:59.980]The next car the boy stopped, | 男孩拦下的下一辆车，
[01:02.710]did not take him into the center of Paris as he hoped it would, | 没有像他希望的那样把他带到巴黎市中心，
[01:06.355]but to Perpignan on the French-Spanish border. | 而是带到了法西边境的佩皮尼昂。
[01:10.255]There, he was picked up by a policeman | 在那里，他被一名警察发现，
[01:13.370]and sent back to England by the local authorities. | 并被地方当局送回了英国。
[01:16.905]He has surely set up a record | 他无疑创造了一项纪录，
[01:19.715]for the thousands of boys who dream of evading school. | 适用于成千上万梦想逃学的男孩们。